<!--
COLUMN GUIDANCE

Symptom — what was observed, not what you assumed was wrong. "Fidelity suite
fails on case 12" rather than "off-by-one in the sampler".

Reproduction — the minimal failing case. A command, a fixture, an input. If
you cannot write this column, you have not reproduced it in isolation yet, and
the fix is a guess.

Root cause — why it happened, one level deeper than the line you changed. "The
cache key omitted locale" rather than "wrong value returned".

Fix — what changed, and whether a regression test now covers it. If no test
covers it, say so explicitly: an uncovered fix is a bug scheduled to return.

Commit — the SHA. Without it this table cannot be audited against the diff.
-->
